OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested as university
OL,4,Abuildings cordoned off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested following
OL,7,Freports of a suspicious item at a
OL,8,Funiversity.
OL,10,FA large police cordon was erected
OL,11,Faround a section of Newcastle
OL,12,FUniversity, closing roads surrounding
OL,13,Fthe Kings Road area of the campus,
OL,14,Fincluding St Thomas' Street and Brewery
OL,15,FLane.
OL,17,FStreets surrounding the university, as
OL,18,Fwell as the nearby Royal Victoria
OL,19,FInfirmary, were taped off by the force,
OL,20,Fcausing disruption on and around
OL,21,Fcampus.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
