OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested as university
OL,4,Abuildings cordoned off
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumbria Police said it had been
OL,7,Fcalled to the site on Kings Road at
OL,8,F14:10 BST. By 18:00 it said the cordon
OL,9,Fhad been lifted, apart from a section
OL,10,Foutside the university's Islamic
OL,11,FSociety.
